  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "In diffraction,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi><mi>sin</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/f49000a6-1eb8-4624-b6db-1325caeb65fe-image.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 183px;\" /><br /><br />Young&rsquo;s fringe width [&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>d</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></math>- the separation between two slits]&nbsp;<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#39;</mi></msup></mfrac></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>50</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#39;</mi></msup></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#39;</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">'</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;m</mi></math>.",
